    {
      "id": "works-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 143,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 295,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172b35",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 105,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT WORKS NOW / observed in source\n1. Sender groups sort by count; a group\ncheckbox targets represented messages.\nmain.rs:1105–1211, 1212–1260\n\n2. Preview and checkmarks coexist without\nmarking mail read; unread has a separate\ndot and weight. main.rs:1117–1194, 1260–1285\n\n3. Archive and Trash have separate staged\nbins, counts, Put back and Apply. Unknown\noutcomes require Recheck Gmail.\nmain.rs:1434–1769; README: Write outcomes",
      "originalText": "WHAT WORKS NOW / observed in source\n1. Sender groups sort by count; a group\ncheckbox targets represented messages.\nmain.rs:1105–1211, 1212–1260\n\n2. Preview and checkmarks coexist without\nmarking mail read; unread has a separate\ndot and weight. main.rs:1117–1194, 1260–1285\n\n3. Archive and Trash have separate staged\nbins, counts, Put back and Apply. Unknown\noutcomes require Recheck Gmail.\nmain.rs:1434–1769; README: Write outcomes",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
