      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 109,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 209,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FOUR PROPOSED CHANGES / 1–2\n1. Move checked count, Archive N, Trash N and Clear into\nan always-present bottom command rail. Today they exist\nonly when selected, in a wrapping toolbar (main.rs:1979–2060).\nStable targets should help repeated keyboard/pointer use.\n\n2. Keep the count-sorted sender group and its checkbox,\nbut expose “40 checked / 2 exempt” next to the expanded\ngroup. Current mixed selection exists (main.rs:1117–1120,\n1242–1260); explicit scope should reduce batch ambiguity.",
      "originalText": "FOUR PROPOSED CHANGES / 1–2\n1. Move checked count, Archive N, Trash N and Clear into\nan always-present bottom command rail. Today they exist\nonly when selected, in a wrapping toolbar (main.rs:1979–2060).\nStable targets should help repeated keyboard/pointer use.\n\n2. Keep the count-sorted sender group and its checkbox,\nbut expose “40 checked / 2 exempt” next to the expanded\ngroup. Current mixed selection exists (main.rs:1117–1120,\n1242–1260); explicit scope should reduce batch ambiguity.",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
