    {
      "id": "changes-right-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 868,
      "y": 508,
      "width": 764,
      "height": 238,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172b35",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FOUR PROPOSED CHANGES / 3–4\n3. Replace the full-height right staging pane with a fixed\npending strip and keyboard-opened review drawer. Today the\nbins and Apply occupy that pane (main.rs:1434–1769), which\ncompetes with list and reader width (main.rs:2080–2116).\nKeep separate Archive/Trash contents in the review drawer.\n\n4. Move Auto-apply out of the toolbar; label it “Immediate\nwrites” in preferences, default OFF, with a persistent mode\nbadge and confirmation when enabled. Its present toggle is\nmain.rs:2058–2067; mode confirmation is main.rs:934–954.\nIn ON mode command labels must say “write now,” not “stage.”",
      "originalText": "FOUR PROPOSED CHANGES / 3–4\n3. Replace the full-height right staging pane with a fixed\npending strip and keyboard-opened review drawer. Today the\nbins and Apply occupy that pane (main.rs:1434–1769), which\ncompetes with list and reader width (main.rs:2080–2116).\nKeep separate Archive/Trash contents in the review drawer.\n\n4. Move Auto-apply out of the toolbar; label it “Immediate\nwrites” in preferences, default OFF, with a persistent mode\nbadge and confirmation when enabled. Its present toggle is\nmain.rs:2058–2067; mode confirmation is main.rs:934–954.\nIn ON mode command labels must say “write now,” not “stage.”",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
